    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17687,
        "title": "Pewarisan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150007,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bayangkan kita sedang membuat game petualangan. Karakter-karakter dalam game ini memiliki banyak kesamaan, tetapi juga berbeda dalam banyak hal.</p><p>Di situlah <strong>inheritance</strong> berperan.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150008,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa membuat class <code>Character</code> untuk menggabungkan <strong>fitur utama</strong> karakter.</p><p>Lalu, menggunakan inheritance, kita bisa <em>memperluas</em>-nya dengan <strong>fungsionalitas tambahan</strong> untuk berbagai tipe karakter.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150009,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk mewarisi fitur dari sebuah class, kita perlu menggunakan keyword <code>extends</code> dalam definisi class.</p><p>Dengan menulis <code>extends</code>, kita akan membuat class <code>Player</code> mewarisi class <code>Character</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"84\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>extends</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150010,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inheritance memberikan sebuah class semua <strong>properti dan method</strong> dari class yang diperluas atau diwarisinya.</p><p>Buktikan sendiri: buat sebuah objek dari class <code>Player</code> dan tampilkan objek tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"116\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"124\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"153\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ranger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Player</code>, lalu <code>\"Ranger\"</code>, <code>player</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150011,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Karena <code>Player</code> mewarisi <code>Character</code>, <code>Player</code> adalah <strong>subclass</strong> dari class <code>Character</code>. Jadi, class <code>Character</code> adalah <strong>superclass</strong>-nya.</p><p>Pastikan class <code>Player</code> mewarisi properti dari superclass-nya, <code>Character</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Character\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Player</code>, diikuti oleh <code>extends</code>, dan terakhir <code>Character</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150012,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa artinya ketika kita mengatakan class <code>A</code> mewarisi dari class <code>B</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Class <code>A</code> dapat mengakses semua properti dan metode milik class <code>B</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Keduanya dapat mengakses properti dan metode satu sama lain</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Class <code>A</code> dapat mengakses semua properti dan metode milik class <code>B</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 150013,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa keyword untuk membuat sebuah class mewarisi class lain?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>extends</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>inherits</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>extends</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 150014,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa sebutan untuk class yang diwarisi oleh class lain?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Superclass</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kelas umum</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Superclass.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 150015,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang diwarisi subclass dari superclass?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">Metode dan propertinya</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Namanya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Metode dan propertinya.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 150016,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat class <code>Boss</code> mewarisi class <code>Enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"81\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>extends</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 150017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Buat objek dari class <code>Boss</code> dan tampilkan objek tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"105\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"113\" /><option startIndex=\"114\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option startIndex=\"130\" endIndex=\"135\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Boss(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemy);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>new</code>, diikuti oleh <code>Boss</code>, lalu <code>5</code>, <code>enemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 150018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pastikan class <code>Boss</code> mewarisi properti dari superclass-nya, <code>Enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"87\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(level) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".level = level;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Boss\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Boss</code>, diikuti oleh <code>extends</code>, dan terakhir <code>Enemy</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17688,
        "title": "Pewarisan Lanjutan",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 150019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jika subclass tidak memiliki metode <code>constructor()</code>, constructor milik superclass menjadi <strong>constructor default</strong>.</p><p>Properti <code>name</code> dari <code>player</code> dibuat melalui konstruktor class <code>Entity</code>. Coba akses properti tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"entity.name\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"140\" endIndex=\"146\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"147\" /><option startIndex=\"147\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rogue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.name);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, dan terakhir <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 150020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Subclass juga mewarisi <strong>method</strong> dari superclass-nya.</p><p>Coba panggil method <code>takeDamage()</code> melalui instance <code>Player</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"250\" endIndex=\"256\" /><option startIndex=\"256\" endIndex=\"257\" /><option startIndex=\"257\" endIndex=\"267\" /><option startIndex=\"267\" endIndex=\"268\" /><option startIndex=\"268\" endIndex=\"270\" /><option startIndex=\"270\" endIndex=\"271\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; took &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>player</code>, diikuti oleh <code>.</code>, lalu <code>takeDamage</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 150021,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita bisa membuat subclass <code>Entity</code> sebanyak yang kita mau. <em>Semuanya</em> akan memiliki akses ke properti class <code>Entity</code>.</p><p>Buat class <code>Enemy</code> mewarisi class <code>Entity</code> dan panggil <code>takeDamage()</code> pada objek <code>Enemy</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"219\" endIndex=\"224\" /><option startIndex=\"225\" endIndex=\"232\" /><option startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"239\" /><option startIndex=\"342\" endIndex=\"352\" /><option startIndex=\"352\" endIndex=\"353\" /><option startIndex=\"353\" endIndex=\"355\" /><option startIndex=\"355\" endIndex=\"356\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp -= amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; took &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount + \" /><text value=\"&quot; damage&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Enemy\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Knight&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Enemy(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"12\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>Enemy</code>, diikuti oleh <code>extends</code>, lalu <code>Entity</code>, <code>takeDamage</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>12</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 150022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inheritance menjadi berguna ketika subclass memiliki <strong>fungsionalitas tambahan</strong>, seperti method-nya sendiri.</p><p>Hanya pemain yang bisa <code>heal()</code>. Tambahkan metode <code>heal()</code> ke class <code>Player</code> dan panggil metode tersebut.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"109\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"235\" endIndex=\"241\" /><option startIndex=\"241\" endIndex=\"242\" /><option startIndex=\"242\" endIndex=\"250\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" heal(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; healed &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cleric&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.heal(\" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>heal(amount)</code>, diikuti oleh <code>player</code>, lalu <code>.</code>, <code>heal(20)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 150023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inheritance hanya bekerja <strong>satu arah</strong>. Tidak semua instance <code>Entity</code> merupakan jenis <code>Player</code>, jadi instance tersebut <em>tidak bisa</em> mengakses fungsionalitas khusus <code>Player</code>.</p><p>Apa yang akan terjadi jika kita mencoba membuat enemy melakukan <code>.heal();</code>, apakah itu akan berhasil?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp = \" /><text value=\"100\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Entity\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" heal(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".hp += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name + \" /><text value=\"&quot; healed &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + amount);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Cleric&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.heal(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemy = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Entity(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"enemy.heal(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tidak, error akan muncul</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Ya, musuh selalu bisa memulihkan kesehatan seperti pemain</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Tidak, error akan muncul.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 150024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana cara membuat instance dari <code>Level</code> dengan properti <code>difficulty</code> yang ditetapkan?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Stage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(difficulty) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".difficulty = difficulty;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Level\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"extends\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Stage\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dengan <code>const level = new Level(\"Hard\");</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Kita tidak bisa, karena <code>Level</code> tidak memiliki konstruktor dengan properti tersebut</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dengan <code>const level = new Level(\"Hard\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
